# Packages installed into the live ISO / final system.
# This starts from the releng base package list (installer tools, drivers,
# etc.) and adds a Hyprland desktop on top. Edit freely — this is the
# easiest lever for "making it yours."
#
# NOTE: this file is layered on top of releng's own packages.x86_64 by
# build.sh copying over it — merge in the releng list if you want to keep
# every driver/tool it ships. For a minimal personal ISO, the essentials
# below are enough to get a working desktop; add hardware drivers
# (nvidia, broadcom-wl, etc.) as you need them.

# --- Base system ---
base
base-devel
linux
linux-firmware
networkmanager
sudo
git
vim

# --- Desktop: Hyprland + essentials ---
hyprland
xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland
kitty              # terminal
waybar             # status bar
wofi               # app launcher
mako               # notifications
grim               # screenshots
slurp
polkit-gnome
qt5-wayland
qt6-wayland

# --- Login manager ---
sddm

# --- Audio ---
pipewire
pipewire-pulse
pipewire-alsa
wireplumber

# --- Fonts (Hyprland/waybar need a Nerd Font for icons) ---
ttf-jetbrains-mono-nerd
noto-fonts
